['**Drag**: snaps to the step; the box shows the value (en-IE grouping, up to 4 decimals); the result updates live.', '**Type**: tapping selects the text; the result updates live once the text is a number; Enter or leaving the box commits and re-formats.', '**Typed precision is kept**; the step applies only when dragging. Pre-filled values off the step show exactly in the box while the thumb sits at the nearest step; results use the box value.', '**Parsing**: only digits, ".", "," and "-" count; commas are thousand separators. Empty, "-" or "." is ignored while typing; on commit the box returns to the last valid value.', '**€ fields above the slider top**: accepted up to 10 × the slider maximum; the slider widens. Above that: clamps, hint "Max €…".', '**Other units** clamp to the slider range; hint "Max 8%", "Max 35 yrs", "Max 12 mo", "Max 70".', '**Below the minimum**: clamps; hint "Min €15,000" (euros) or "Min 1" (others, no unit).', '**Hint timing**: shows as soon as the text passes a limit and stays after Enter or leaving the box; clears on the next in-range value.', '**Whole numbers only**: years, months and ages with a whole-number step round a typed decimal and show the hint "Whole numbers only" (e.g. 2.5 → 3).', '**Touched fields win** over any pre-fill for the session; a new statement upload resets the tool to the statement.', '**Keyboard**: inputmode="decimal" when the step has decimals or the unit is %, else "numeric".'].forEach(t => push(B(t)));
