[':focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--sun);outline-offset:2px}; chips and buttons: 3px solid var(--ink), offset 3px.', 'Screen titles get focus on a new screen (tabindex="-1", no visible outline).', 'Sliders and value boxes are labelled by the visible label (aria-labelledby), which includes the statement tag. Chip groups are role="group" labelled by the field label; chips use aria-pressed.', 'The result region is aria-live="polite"; hints are role="status".', 'Emoji in rows, tiles and units are aria-hidden; the title emoji is not (hide it in the build).', 'Sliders carry aria-valuetext with the formatted value and unit (e.g. "€60,000").', 'Tap targets: value box 44px, small buttons 44px, chips 40–46px.', 'prefers-reduced-motion: all animation off.', 'Mobile first: below 800 px wide the phone frame is dropped; on desktop the app shows in a 390×844 frame.'].forEach(t => push(B(t)));

